# PaperAssistant runs against the shared 6x7-platform Supabase project.
#
# On Vercel: the Supabase ↔ Vercel integration auto-injects these on every
# deploy once the Vercel project is linked to the 6x7 Supabase project. You
# do not paste keys manually in production.
#
